摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness（DSH）一站式增强套件，基于公开插件扩展点构建，无需修改 DSH Core。提供 Windows Launcher、桌面通知与动态桌宠、Plugin Community、MCP Server Manager、模型输入类型配置、最后一条消息编辑与重新生成，以及 Claude Code / Codex Subagents 实时控制。所有功能均可独立安装，支持全量部署、按需组合、升级迁移与安全卸载。","id":"gh:1338954001","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-enhanced-plugins","slug":"sky-unicorn/dsh-enhanced-plugins","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness（DSH）一站式增强套件，基于公开插件扩展点构建，无需修改 DSH Core。提供 Windows Launcher、桌面通知与动态桌宠、Plugin Communit"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"y、MCP Server Manager、模型输入类型配置、最后一条消息编辑与重新生成，以及 Claude Code / Codex Subagents 实时控制。所有功能均可独立安装，支持全量部署、"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"nager、模型输入类型配置、最后一条消息编辑与重新生成，以及 Claude Code / Codex Subagents 实时控制。所有功能均可独立安装，支持全量部署、按需组合、升级迁移与安全卸载。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-enhanced-plugins"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"中文 | English"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"An enhancement suite for DeepSeek Harness (DSH): **seven independently installable Cordis bundles pl"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"us one Windows companion**."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- Does not modify DSH core; every Web feature uses public plugin extension points.\n- Installs everyt"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"hing in one pass or keeps only the independently packaged features you select.\n- Keeps Host, Web Cli"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ent, and Windows Companion lifecycles and security boundaries separate."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Features · Quick start · Feature guide · Compatibility and migration · Configuration · Development"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### 8.1.0: DSH 0.1.7-rc.1 compatibility"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- Non-Beta standalone bundles support DSH `0.1.7-rc.1` at verified commit `46a7f68b0922371ce7144b668"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"b90e377d8e799f4`. This release fixes icons and message-editing interfaces, migrates legacy MCP and s"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ubagent settings, and improves Launcher installation state and source-change detection.\n- The aggreg"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"ate, seven standalone bundles, and Windows Launcher use `8.1.0`. The Beta `agent-team-monitor` and `"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"model-router` features remain limited to DSH `0.1.7-alpha.1`, so the aggregate declares only that ve"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"rsion. Select the non-Beta features individually on rc.1."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### 7.3.0: DSH 0.1.7-alpha.1 compatibility"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- Updated settings forms to the DSH 0.1.7 volatile configuration API, migrated Agent Team session pr"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ojections and tool-result messages, and preserved edit-last-message attribution.\n- The aggregate, al"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"l standalone bundles, and Windows Launcher use `7.3.0`, supporting DSH `0.1.7-alpha.1` at verified c"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"ommit `c36a83ff6bb95e3f82cf79f9be7c724270a8aa61`. The Beta `agent-team-monitor` and `model-router` f"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"eatures target this DSH release."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### 7.2.3: DSH 0.1.6-alpha.2 compatibility"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- Fix Launcher-started DSH tool calls failing with `Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'pr"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"epare')`: source checkouts now launch Web, Headless, and profiles through the built `apps/cli/lib/bi"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"n.js`, avoiding mixed source/build module identities under `tsx`. Reinstall Launcher and restart Web"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"mixed source/build module identities under `tsx`. Reinstall Launcher and restart Web after updating."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Plugin `7.2.3` was validated against DSH `0.1.6-alpha.2` at source commit `ddefc45fbc7f8e46dd73185e6"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"8295696d1297887`. Current supported pairings are maintained in `dsh-compatibility.json`. If the remo"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"te table lacks this plugin version or DSH version, the installer checks the bundled table before ref"},{"id":"p13s4","text":" plugin version or DSH version, the installer checks the bundled table before refusing installation."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The `model-input-types` feature is retired because DSH now provides per-model Text and Image control"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"s under Settings → Models → Custom settings → Model options. An update removes the old standalone bu"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"ndle while preserving model settings in DSH. MCP configuration remains on the bundle row in sidebar "},{"id":"p14s4","text":"Plugins and discards unsaved drafts when its page closes. Team Monitor follows the main Conversation"},{"id":"p14s5","text":" through `mainView` references and opens members through `uiWorkspace.openSession()`, independently "},{"id":"p14s6","text":"of sidebar-retained children. All six bundles and Windows Launcher share this release. Typecheck rej"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"ects DSH artifacts missing the new configuration and session-reference APIs."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"This release reduces repeated Launcher layout during navigation, scrolling, and feature filtering, a"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"nd refreshes button labels when launch mode changes. Each function retains its latest execution log,"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" with bounded reads for the UI."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Requirements"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- Node.js 22.19.x, or Node.js 24 and later.\n- A recent DSH Web profile that runs from source; see th"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"e DSH Web UI quickstart.\n- Verified DSH source baseline for non-Beta features: `0.1.7-rc.1`. The two"},{"id":"p18s3","text":" Beta features remain limited to `0.1.7-alpha.1`. See `dsh-compatibility.json` and each standalone m"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"anifest for feature limits and other versions.\n- This DSH version no longer requires `fs-ext` for Se"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"ssion locking. Follow the target checkout’s native build requirements; Launcher uses the system .NET"},{"id":"p18s6","text":" Framework `csc.exe`. Do not skip dependency install scripts.\n- Windows Launcher, native sounds, and"},{"id":"p18s7","text":" the desktop pet require a full Windows desktop edition with Windows PowerShell 5.1: Windows 10 vers"},{"id":"p18s8","text":"ion 1607 or later, or Windows 11. The required OS capabilities are the same on Home, Pro, Education "},{"id":"p18s9","text":"/ Pro Education, and Enterprise; Windows in S mode, IoT / reduced-footprint editions, and Windows 10"},{"id":"p18s10","text":" versions 1507 and 1511 are outside this baseline. Windows feature updates outside Microsoft's lifec"},{"id":"p18s11","text":"ycle are best-effort because the required Node.js toolchain does not guarantee end-of-life operating"},{"id":"p18s12","text":" systems. The installer does not depend on a particular `tar.exe`. The remaining features are cross-"},{"id":"p18s13","text":" The installer does not depend on a particular `tar.exe`. The remaining features are cross-platform."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"> [!IMPORTANT]\n> DSH remains a developer preview. If a DSH upgrade causes compatibility issues, chec"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"k the verified version and commit above first."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"> [!CAUTION]\n> **Check the DSH/plugin repository layout before copying an install command:**\n>\n> - *"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"*Sibling-directory install:** both repositories share the **same parent directory**; use the command"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"s below as written.\n> - **Different-directory install:** the repositories have **different parent di"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"rectories**; add `-DshCheckout \"absolute path to the DSH source\"` to the command."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Compatibility and migration"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- **Version pairing:** `dsh-compatibility.json` is the authority for each plugin release’s supported"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" DSH versions and verified commits. The aggregate, all seven standalone bundles, and Windows Launche"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"r use `8.1.0`.\n- **DSH 0.1.7-rc.1:** Verified non-Beta standalone bundles can be selected. `agent-te"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"am-monitor` and `model-router` remain limited to `0.1.7-alpha.1`; the aggregate bundle containing th"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"em declares only that version. Launcher and the installer check the final selected features before b"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"uilding or changing a Profile.\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
